  lines:
  - 'Watch out for goblins! They''re small, nasty creatures that will attack you
    without warning. '
  - They're quick and agile, and can cause serious harm with their sharp claws and
    teeth. Be prepared to defend yourself!
  - 'Also, while you''re on your journey, keep an eye out for 5 coins. If you find
    them, keep them. I have a feeling they could come in handy. '
